@startuml Model Artifact Promotion Workflow
!theme blueprint
title Model Artifact Promotion (GCS → Hugging Face Hub)
caption Workflow identified by Copilot analysis, validated against codebase

skinparam BackgroundColor transparent
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor<<Training>> #E3F2FD
    BackgroundColor<<GCS>> #FFF3E0
    BackgroundColor<<Validation>> #E8F5E9
    BackgroundColor<<HuggingFace>> #FCE4EC
    BackgroundColor<<Error>> #FFEBEE
    BorderColor #2C3E50
}

|Training|
start
:Modal GPU Training<<Training>>;
note right
  **Script:** modal/train_phase2_iqa.py

  **Outputs:**
  - model_final.pth
  - model_epoch_XX.pth (checkpoints)
  - training_config.yaml
  - metrics.json
end note

:Generate Run Metadata<<Training>>;
note right
  **Functions:**
  - generate_run_id()
  - generate_run_metadata()

  **Required Files:**
  - commit_hash.txt
  - dataset_version.txt
  - env_info.txt
end note

|GCS Storage|
:Upload to GCS<<GCS>>;
note right
  **Function:** upload_run_to_gcs()
  **Module:** src/utils/gcs_uploader.py

  **Bucket Structure:**
  gs://image_detection_b/
    models/
      phase2_iqa/
        runs/
          2025-11-22T01-20Z_run-abc123/
            model_final.pth
            training_config.yaml
            metrics.json
            commit_hash.txt
            ...
end note

:GCS is Canonical Archive<<GCS>>;
note right
  **Principles:**
  1. Every run saved to GCS
  2. Immutable run directories
  3. Complete reproducibility metadata
  4. Checkpoints preserved
end note

|Validation|
partition "Pre-Promotion Validation" {
  :List Available Runs<<Validation>>;
  note right
    **Command:**
    python scripts/promote_to_hf.py \\
      --list-runs \\
      --model resnet50_teacher

    **Shows:**
    - Run IDs
    - Timestamps
    - Metrics summary
  end note

  :Select Run for Promotion<<Validation>>;

  :Dry Run Validation<<Validation>>;
  note right
    **Command:**
    python scripts/promote_to_hf.py \\
      --dry-run \\
      --run-id <run_id> \\
      --version v1.0.0

    **Checks:**
    - All required files present
    - Metrics meet baseline
    - Clean git state
  end note

  :Check Promotion Criteria<<Validation>>;
  note right
    **Quality Gates:**
    - [ ] Performance: mAP > 0.88
    - [ ] Reproducibility: clean git
    - [ ] Completeness: all metadata
    - [ ] Documentation: model card
    - [ ] Validation: held-out test
    - [ ] Version: semantic (vX.Y.Z)
  end note

  if (All Criteria Met?) then (yes)
    :Proceed to Promotion;
  else (no)
    :Block Promotion<<Error>>;
    note right
      **Reasons:**
      - Performance below baseline
      - Missing metadata files
      - Dirty git state
      - No semantic version

      **Action:** Fix issues and retry
    end note
    stop
  endif
}

|Hugging Face Hub|
partition "Promotion Process" {
  :Download from GCS<<GCS>>;
  note right
    **Temporary Local:**
    ./promotion_temp/
      model_final.pth
      training_config.yaml
      metrics.json
      ...
  end note

  :Generate Model Card<<HuggingFace>>;
  note right
    **Module:** scripts/promote_to_hf.py
    **Function:** generate_model_card()

    **README.md Contents:**
    - Model description
    - Training details
    - Performance metrics
    - Usage examples
    - License
    - Citation
  end note

  :Create/Update HF Repository<<HuggingFace>>;
  note right
    **Function:** create_repo()

    **Repository:**
    - Private or public
    - Model type: pytorch
    - Tags: document-quality, iqa
  end note

  :Upload Model Files<<HuggingFace>>;
  note right
    **Uploaded:**
    - model_final.pth
    - config.yaml
    - README.md (model card)
    - metrics.json

    **Excluded:**
    - Intermediate checkpoints
    - Large training logs
  end note

  :Create Version Tag<<HuggingFace>>;
  note right
    **Semantic Version:**
    v1.0.0, v1.1.0, v2.0.0

    **Tag Message:**
    - Release notes
    - Performance summary
    - Breaking changes
  end note

  :Verify Upload<<HuggingFace>>;
  note right
    **Checks:**
    - Files accessible
    - Model loadable
    - README renders
    - Version tag exists
  end note
}

:Promotion Complete<<HuggingFace>>;
note right
  **Output:**
  https://huggingface.co/org/model-name

  **Available via:**
  from huggingface_hub import hf_hub_download

  model_path = hf_hub_download(
      repo_id="org/model-name",
      filename="model_final.pth",
      revision="v1.0.0"
  )
end note

stop

legend right
  **Commands Reference:**

  **List runs:**
  python scripts/promote_to_hf.py \\
    --list-runs \\
    --gcs-bucket image_detection_b \\
    --model resnet50_teacher

  **Dry run:**
  python scripts/promote_to_hf.py \\
    --dry-run \\
    --run-id <run_id> \\
    --version v1.0.0

  **Promote:**
  python scripts/promote_to_hf.py \\
    --gcs-bucket image_detection_b \\
    --model resnet50_teacher \\
    --run-id <run_id> \\
    --hf-repo org/model-name \\
    --version v1.0.0 \\
    --private

  **Environment:**
  export HF_TOKEN=<token>
  export GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=<path>

  **Documentation:**
  docs/MODEL_STORAGE.md
endlegend

@enduml
